# DRAFTER ONLY. This file is documentation and is never loaded automatically.
# Drafting (`pros run --allow-paid`) reads exactly one variable. Set it only in your user
# environment (from a password manager), never in a file, VS Code settings, CI or this repository:
#   PowerShell: $env:PROS_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY = "..."
# Use a key from a dedicated Anthropic Console workspace that has a monthly spend limit.
# A Claude Code login or subscription is not an API key and is never used.
PROS_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Must stay unset: the SDK lets it replace the key header, so drafting refuses to run.
# ANTHROPIC_CUSTOM_HEADERS=
# NEVER add BUFFER_API_KEY or social OAuth credentials here.
